  FBI Director Kash Patel indicates that the person recently arrested was
  not the one who shot Charlie Kirk. This raises suspicions that the attack
  may have been planned by some intelligence agency, probably outside
  the United States.
  In Xposed Magazine, we doubt that the real killer and the people behind
  this attack will be captured. Everything seems to have been a well-
  planned operation by foreign actors.
  We are living through very difficult times, and more than ever, we must
  commend ourselves to God...who do you think killed him?
